ex:Ev_Template a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Page template 9.7.0 from the owner's feedback on the pages"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Template/Ch05" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "08-tooling/template_patch_v9_7_0.py made course_page_template_v9_7_0.html from 9.6.0 (the patch regenerates the file exactly; checked by comparison) and sen0414_page_test_v9_7_0.py tested it on the chapter 5 page: a concept section shows a static Example with no button (0 buttons in the 22 static example widgets of the chapter, no Walk-through text); the sub-page heading is hidden under the tab row and view notes are folded into an About fold; measured in a 1400x900 window, the concept map now starts 154 pixels from the top instead of 288 on page 9.6.0, the taxonomy 154 instead of 229, and the playground and Code Lab 187 instead of 262; the playground's code area takes the free height (bottom at 60% of a 900-pixel window) and no code area scrolls inside itself at 1400x900 or 1280x720; a Lecture tab and a Resources tab exist with their own checks; the debugger, level and unwinding visuals work. All 55 checks passed and the earlier 50 checks of the template carried over unchanged. The published chapter 3 page 9.6.0 and the pages of chapters 1, 2 and 4 were not changed." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run over the artefacts as published in sen0414-v2.31.0." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_7_0.py in headless Chromium on the chapter 5 page; 08-tooling/template_patch_v9_7_0.py regenerates the template from 9.6.0" ; backlog:verifiedAt "2026-09-29T08:09:00"^^xsd:dateTime .
