ex:Ev_Bank a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for A written question bank for the chapter 5 page"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Bank/Ch05" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Question bank 1.0.0 (08-tooling/ch05-page/question_bank_v1_0_0.json): 73 written items covering all 46 concepts (6 Remember, 40 Understand, 25 Apply, 2 Analyze), answer positions balanced; 08-tooling/ch05-page/question_bank_check_v1_0_0.py checks structure and re-runs the 25 programs under Python 3.14.4 and compares the marked answer with what they print. Page 9.10.0: 08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_10_0.py passed all its checks in headless Chromium (54 of 54 widgets and every earlier check): the builder offers the written item as a kind, 'One question for every concept' asked the written item for all 46 concepts, shuffled items keep their right answer, and every bank item with code was re-run in the page's own Python (Pyodide) with the marked answer equal to what it printed. A fixture with one stored result altered was refused by three checks. Acceptance @ Courseware on the page and its ABox: web accessibility, model provenance, assessment rigour and Bloom coverage pass; the attestation is pending, not claimed." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run over the artefacts as published in sen0414-v2.34.0." ;
