ex:Ev_Enrich a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Clickable references, a page-wide search and grounded replies on the pages of chapters 1 to 6"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Enrich/Ch05" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page template 9.12.0 and the pages of chapters 1 to 6 rebuilt on it: every source chip and inline [n] in an agent's answer opens its passage in the detail card (kind, file, full text, the concepts it mentions, a search for it) and the chip is marked; a page-wide search (button, the / key, Ctrl+K) over concepts, definitions and code, and on request over the book, course and research passages; the local model's reply is checked against the passages it was given and unsupported sentences are removed (a wholly unsupported reply is replaced by the passages' own sentences, with a note); 'how is X written' also shows the concept's worked example or written form. sen0414_page_test_v9_12_0.py passed in headless Chromium on all six pages (79 to 83 checks each; no console errors; WCAG 2 AA clean). The stale-result fixture was run for all six (every stored output altered) and refused the three features it should, plus the evaluation steps for five. Page ABoxes as new files (1.3.0 for chapters 1 to 4, 1.1.0 for chapters 5 and 6); acceptance @ Courseware: web accessibility, model provenance, assessment rigour and Bloom coverage pass, the attestation is pending, not claimed. Stage 4 gates: coverage and substance fail and hybrid chains cannot run, as before; not claimed." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run over the artefacts as published in sen0414-v2.37.0." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/template_patch_v9_12_0.py; 08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_12_0.py in headless Chromium on all six pages; 08-tooling/sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py" ; backlog:verifiedAt "2026-09-30T08:43:00"^^xsd:dateTime .
